<p>
  <%= @invited_by ? "#{@invited_by.nickname} invited you to #{@tenant_name}." : "You have been invited to #{@tenant_name}." %>
</p>

<p>
  Your username is <strong><%= @actor.nickname %></strong>. Open the link below
  to choose a password and finish setting up the account.
</p>

<p><%= link_to @url, @url %></p>

<p>
  The link works once, and expires in
  <%= ActiveSupport::Duration.build(Invitation.lifetime.to_i).inspect %>. If you
  were not expecting this, you can ignore it — nothing happens until somebody
  opens the link.
</p>
